/ripple-chris-larsen-senator-gillibrand-son-venture-market-structure-bill</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/ripple-chris-larsen-senator-gillibrand-son-venture-market-structure-bill?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://s3-images.ctmedia.io/media/article-covers/bribe-money-corrupt-usa.jpg\" alt=\"Ripple co-founder backs venture launched by US senator's son: Report\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>While engaged in negotiations over ethics in a crypto market structure bill in Congress, Senator Kirsten Gillibrand said she had \u201cno involvement\u201d in her son\u2019s derivatives exchange, backed by at least one industry figure.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Turner Wright</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://s3-images.ctmedia.io/media/article-covers/bribe-money-corrupt-usa.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://s3-images.ctmedia.io/media/article-covers/bribe-money-corrupt-usa.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpeg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n  </channel>\n</rss>"
